DESCRIPTION:Steve Gerben is a comedian\, writer\, actor\, and executive pro
 ducer best known for co-creating and starring in the Netflix series Tires. 
 In the show\, he plays Will\, an awkward but well-meaning manager trying to
  run his family’s struggling auto shop—a role that showcases his talent
  for dry\, understated comedy. Gerben co-created Tires with longtime collab
 orators Shane Gillis and John McKeever\, and the show quickly found success
 \, earning a second season shortly after its debut. Prior to Tires\, Gerben
  worked with Gillis and McKeever on several projects\, including the viral 
 sketch series Gilly & Keeves and the Comedy Central web series Delco Proper
 \, where he played Gordy. He also appeared in the 2022 holiday film Holly a
 nd the Hot Chocolate as Mayor Steve.\n\nBeyond his work on screen\, Gerben 
 is a frequent guest on popular podcasts like Matt & Shane’s Secret Podcas
 t and Flagrant\, where his offbeat humor and candid storytelling continue t
 o build his following.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n
 - $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protect
 ion\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the
  facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore inf
 o: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-steve-gerben/
